      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i don't even exist anymore. like i'm just a cog in this massive machine that doesn't care if i'm here or not. it's just work, eat, sleep, repeat. i'm just a tool for everyone else's benefit and there's nothing left of me inside.",
